I wouldn''t have thought to shoot in this aspect ratio for this. I think it works nicely to create flow and rhythm within those patches. Quiltwork (or patchwork, I guess?) is a big part of the immigrant heritage here in central Texas; you can see little squares painted on signs all across the countryside indicating families'' identification with Czech-Germanic-Wendish heritage. So this one brought a smile for me.</td>', 'I wouldn''t have thought to shoot in this aspect ratio for this. I think it works nicely to create flow and rhythm within those patches. Quiltwork (or patchwork, I guess?) is a big part of the immigrant heritage here in central Texas; you can see little squares painted on signs all across the countryside indicating families'' identification with Czech-Germanic-Wendish heritage. So this one brought a smile for me.', '2025-12-29 00:20:41.000000', NULL, 0),
